  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Get the media params for a particular <b>face</b> on a <b>link</b>ed prim, given the desired list of named <i>param</i>s.</p>
  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=Category:LSL_List/parameters&action=edit&redlink=1" target="_blank">parameter list</a> (a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/List" target="_blank">list</a>) of values in the order requested.</p>
</p>
